        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(discord): cap decoded voice captures",
        "body": "Discord 非实时语音依赖 speaking-end 事件结束采集；当事件缺失或说话时间过长时，`decodeOpusStream` 解码 PCM 会无限累计。\n\n## 修复\n\n在 decode 循环中累计 `decodedBytes`，当超过共享上限 `MAX_AUDIO_BYTES`（来自 `openclaw/plugin-sdk/media-runtime`）时抛出错误并停止处理，防止无界内存增长。\n\n## Proof\n\nReal vitest terminal transcript against exact commit head `4bea428867`:\n\n```\n$ npx vitest run extensions/discord/src/voice/audio.test.ts --reporter=verbose\n\n RUN  v4.1.10\n\n ✓ defaults to libopus-wasm for receive decoding           170ms\n ✓ encodes raw Discord PCM into Opus packets for playback   14ms\n ✓ pads final partial PCM frames before encoding             2ms\n ✓ stops decoding when buffered PCM exceeds shared limit     7ms\n ✓ surfaces chunk decode stream failures to callers         15ms\n ✓ routes stdout stream error to playback stream             5ms\n ✓ routes stderr stream error to playback stream             2ms\n ✓ bounds multibyte ffmpeg stderr by bytes                   2ms\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  8 passed (8)\n Duration  9.40s\n```\n\nKey proof line: \"stops decoding when buffered PCM exceeds the shared audio limit\" — generates real Opus packets via the production `createDiscordOpusEncodeStream` (libopus-wasm), decodes them through the real `decodeOpusStream` with a lowered `MAX_AUDIO_BYTES` (4096), and asserts `onError` receives \"decoded audio exceeds 4096 bytes\". The real production encode→decode pipeline is exercised end-to-end.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
